<title>USA: Consolidated Papers Inc Q4 net falls.</title>
<headline>Consolidated Papers Inc Q4 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>WISCONSIN RAPIDS, Wis. 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Dec 31	   Twelve months</p>
<p>		    1996	1995		1996	 1995</p>
<p> Net sales    $364,034   $452,650     $1,545,091 $1,579,061</p>
<p>Cost of goods sold</p>
<p>		   287,594    309,799	1,175,304  1,127,286</p>
<p> Gross profit   76,440    142,851	  369,787    451,775</p>
<p> SGA		22,606     17,346	   78,527     67,025</p>
<p>Income before</p>
<p>  income taxes  52,951    124,426	  289,170    380,745</p>
<p>Provision for income</p>
<p>  taxes	   15,731     51,356	  109,885    151,515</p>
<p> Net income     37,220     73,070	  179,285    229,230</p>
<p> EPS		  0.83	 1.64	     4.01	 5.16</p>
<p> Avg shrs   44,714,664 44,594,405     44,674,982 44,418,780</p>
<p>(Dollars in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said a lower 1996 tax rate resulted in an improvement of $0.12 a share for the year, which was recorded during the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
